&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; margin-bottom: 18px; text-align: left"&gt;　重要な設備の除却等はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:PlannedAdditionsRetirementsEtcOfFacilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:TotalNumberOfSharesTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h5&gt;①【株式の総数】&lt;/h5&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 646px"&gt;
